      |                                                                                          |
      |                                                                                          |
      |                  ARPACK DSAUPD/DSEUPD: Implicitly Restarted Lanczos                      |
      |                  Method (IRLM) for real symmetric matrix.                                |
      |                                         ================                                 |
      |                                                                                          |
      |                  Computes NEV = 2 eigenvalues of largest algebraic                       |
      |                  value (WHICH = LA) and corresponding eigenvectors.                      |
      |                                                                                          |
      |                  Mode 1: A*x = lambda*x  (standard symmetric)                            |
      |                                                                                          |
      |                  Source: ARPACK-NG 3.9.1                                                 |
      |                  https://github.com/opencollab/arpack-ng                                 |
      |                                                                                          |
      |                  Documentation: ARPACK Users Guide                                       |
      |                  R.B. Lehoucq, D.C. Sorensen, C. Yang                                    |
      |                  SIAM, Philadelphia, 1998                                                |
      |                                                                                          |
      |                  Suitable for medium full dense and sparse matrices - standard           |
      |                                                                                          |
      |                  Test matrix: 4x4 symmetric tridiagonal (FEA-like)                       |
      |                  Analytical eigenvalues ~= 0.382, 1.382, 2.618,                          |
      |                  3.618  (lambda_k = 2 - 2*cos(k*pi/5))                                   |
      |                                                                                          |
      |                                                                                          |
      |                                                                                          |
      +------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
 
 
 
 
            >>>>>     DSAUPD: INFO =            0
            >>>>>     DSAUPD: IPARAM(5) converged Ritz values =            2
 
 
            >>>>>     DSEUPD: IERR =            0
 
 
 
 
